  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach basic attack adds 1%
    attack speed to this ally, up to 20% this wave. A hit from every third basic
    attack can make a 0.8-radius blast at 15% weapon damage; 1s cooldown, no recursive
    blast.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Collision damage: +1\nChampion / Maximum
    health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support
    sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nTheir coastal family measures tides
    by rising dough. A storm took their street but left its breakfast bell. They
    carry the bell toward the coast, hoping a familiar sound will gather the scattered
    neighbours.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero
    for 1.5 HP before healing modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents
    count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied
    by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately
    at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: hearth, gauntlet. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
